# Host artifacts must never enter the build context: pnpm's node_modules are
# symlinks into a local store, so copying them in produces broken links and a
# huge image. Everything is installed inside the image instead.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
apps/android
apps/ios
